{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/825300-cod-mage-magnum-opus-actual-play","id":825300,"title":"[CoD/Mage] Magnum Opus - Actual Play","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-07T00:04:58-08:00","id":825300,"title":"[CoD/Mage] Magnum Opus - Actual Play","content":"Few weeks ago I started new mortal chronicle in preparing to the coming of 2ED <b>Mage: the Awakening</b>. I was planning on running it only on few sessions and switching to fresh <b>Mage</b>, but delays in publishing of new corebook came in my way. Instead, until pointed otherwise, it\u2019s a mortal investigator game on rules from <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> corebook \u2013 only spiced a bit with elements of <b>Mage</b> here and there, laying ground work go Awakening of characters. I have also a bit problem with a plot as it is \u2013 but it will be marked in the end of third post, when I catch up with story as it is.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s my first Actual Play in English so point me to things you want to know. It will be written in shorter form, as language of Brits is my second one, making me write it much longer than I would want with my limited free time \u2013 and for any mistakes I apologize in advance. Also, there could be longer pauses in my writing back, as putting those things really took me hell lot a time compared to taking notes in Polish. Game is with bi-weekly sessions, for my buddies in RPG club in my home city of Lublin in Poland. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Themes</span></b><br /> Marked in chronicle title, <b>Magnum Opus</b> is strongly based on ideas of Alchemy. Precisely Alchemy best described in <i>Uncrowned Kings</i> Legacy from <b>Mage: the Awakening </b>1ED corebook. This <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/668690-mystery-supernal-alchemy-philosopher-s-stone\">Supernal Alchemy</a> is transformative Art that change your Mind, Body and Soul \u2013 and all the World around you to reflect that. Story is deep submerge in to your own psyche and power to become something more \u2013 and to <i>get </i>something more in the process. Characters get <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/668690-mystery-supernal-alchemy-philosopher-s-stone\">Philosopher's Stone</a> on first game session \u2013 but their <i>real</i> Magnum Opus has only begun. Or at least this is the plan for this game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Setting</span></b><br /> <span style=\"font-size:13px\">Chronicle is located in small town of </span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wendell,_Massachusetts\" target=\"_blank\">Wendell</a><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> in Massachusetts. It\u2019s very much \u201emy New England\u201d, with large dose of licentia poetica. Think about this community much more as one of settlements you found in Stephen King\u2019s books or like </span><b>Twin Peaks</b><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> from David Lynch series. Add a spice of Lovecraft here and there and you will understand the feel I want to convey. It has chosen real world town name only so I could gauge distance to Amherst and Boston easily. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> To Amherst it\u2019s little over 30 minutes ride. To Boston it\u2019s a bit under 2 hours to get by car.</span><br /> <br /> Wendell from <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> is small town \u201cin the middle of nowhere\u201d, surrounded by dense forests and nearby river, with less than 900 citizens. You can go in to it by riding about quarter of an hour from main roads \u2013 but you still feel a bit isolated. It has one church of congregation calling itself <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/799082-cofd-diy-mystery-cults#post799082\">Good Christians</a> that is gnostic cult, in reality. It\u2019s ruled by the Reverend <i>Joseph J. Kleckner</i> - under 40 self-proclaimed Hand of God, <i>Holly Lawson</i> ( known as <i>Miss Holly</i> ) - few years older leader of the parish community, <i>Walter Boddie</i> \u2013 middle aged, caring ( to citizens ) Mayor and <i>Justin D. Hale</i> \u2013 young but devoted worshiper which is said to do <b>anything</b> for his faith.<br /> <br /> Settlement has small clinic in that <i>Lian</i> is nurse under one doctor <i>Jacob Martin</i>. It has a bit prominent cemetery (connected to Good Christians) and one funeral home run from generations by <i>Hall</i> family. There is a dinner (did not prepared it yet, details soon) and school combining everything from elementary to high school levels. There is also bakery next to grocery store, run by old Russian immigrant, <i>Vladimir Vladimirovich</i>, in that <i>James </i>got job few months back. Beside the town, on the hill, for over 150 years stand Victorian mansion, with gargoyles and a like gothic elements, now empty for over two decades from it\u2019s last buyer. There are some weird kid\u2019s stories about that place.<br /> <br /> As to greater setting, chronicle take place in New England from <b>Mage</b> line, based mostly on <b>Boston Unveiled</b> material. I develop slowly an update on it to proper 2ED setting \u2013 more can be <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/784966-2ed-new-england-setting\">read here</a>, in <b>Mage</b> subforum topic. Plan is to let character resolve cult plotline in Wendell, Awaken them and dwell in to Mystery of Philosopher Stone a bit. Then Boston Concilium comes to them in persons seeking Alchemy, wanting to get what characters got from Alchemist. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Players Characters</span></b><br /> Story protagonists are living in Wendell for some time. Two are raised here, one is citizen for a few years now and only <i>James</i> is half year in town. What they have in common \u2013 besides getting Philosopher Stone \u2013 is that they are pushed a bit sideways by the town\u2019s community. They live here, but also are not part of this place, not really. I marked for what players and I are aiming with Path of PCs \u2013 character themselves, obviously, do not know what Path they will get into.<ul><li><b>James Rodney</b> \u2013 twenty-something local baker, that is something hiding before the rest. He tries to join the community of Church of Good Christians and is Wendell citizen in only last half of year. Aiming for Acanthus Awakening.</li> <li><b>John Beckett</b> \u2013 Englishman after thirty, liking trench coats, mythology lecturer in Amherst with dark past. Lives in Wendell few years back, coming from Boston. Aiming for Mastigos Awakening.</li> <li><b>Lian Mavis</b> \u2013 silent and calm young nurse from local clinic, devoted to the Church of Good Christians. Born and raised in Wendell. Aiming for Moros Awakening.</li> <li><b>Madline \u201eMarble\u201d Hall</b> \u2013 incredibly pale, but innocent high school girl that helps her few years older brother Richard in running family\u2019s funeral home after death of both parents. Born and raised in Wendell. Aiming for Moros Awakening.</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-07T03:24:06-08:00","id":825337,"title":"","content":"So here starts sum up of chronicle to this day...<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Magnum Opus</span><br /> Opus Magnum \u2013 Session 1</span></b><br /> Story starts precise week before Easter of 2016 year. In small town of Wendell in Massachusetts, just after dusk in Sunday of Spring Equinox - 20th March 2016 - four people were invited to long empty Victorian mansion on the hill, near town. Inside, they found old, bearded man that entertained them and said to them he is Nick <i>Fleming</i>, the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/668690-mystery-supernal-alchemy-philosopher-s-stone?p=770207#post770207\">Alchemist</a> - and propose to make for them Philosopher's Stone, that each can grant them one wish! Only that price for each one of Stones will be one human life the Stone will take in sleep. After some debating, four strangers agreed to terms of Alchemist and pointed vague conditions on that people will die for their Stone - <i>John</i> pointed that will die first person from Wendell that call for ambulance. <i>James</i> asked that neighbor from across will. <i>Lian</i> pointed to very sick patient. <i>Madline</i> said that will die first client that enters funeral home. And so it happened.<br /> <br /> <b>Note:</b> <i>I was not sure if I need to roll on Integrity Breaking Point in this situation. Character agree to kill other people, but also did not know if this is not really some bad joke or something \u2013 as they <b>do not</b> know about Magic. Also, I rather stick to Breaking Point rolls after the confirmation on characters actions \u2013 it typically comes with \u201coh dear, I did it\u201d moments. Still, I did not roll on Integrity even later, when character were also confronted with those actions \u2013 as rules were hazy on to this and I did not wanted to break the flow of the game.</i><br /> <br /> Later, just after visit in <i>James</i> and <i>Lian</i> tried to make to the mass that start Holy Week in local Church of Good Christians, but they were late because of their meeting with Fleming. The dedicated religion characters were throw <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/DisapprovingLook\" target=\"_blank\">Disapproving Look</a> by the leaders of community, mainly <i>Miss Holly</i>.<br /> <br /> <b>Next day, on Monday 21<sup>st</sup> March,</b> protagonists returned to their work - but as hours passed, more people in the town were found dead. First, 30 something Miss <i>Shannon Evans</i> come to Hall\u2019s Funeral Home with her 5 year old son <i>Max</i> come early in the morning. <i>Madline</i> let her in, even when she understood it could be a death with for the woman. Almost crying, <i>Shannon</i> told about body of young dead husband she found in the bad today morning. She plead to help her and prepare ceremony by <i>Madline</i> and <i>Richard</i> alone, as she does not have nerves. Siblings agreed to take the \u201ccase\u201d.<br /> <br /> <b>Note:</b> <i>Yes, Mr. and Mrs. Evans were neighbors of James. Players were suspecting two more deaths in this morning.</i><br /> <br /> <i>John </i>having free day because students canceled classes because of spring break, wanted to stay at home. <i>Lian</i> pickup early the ambulance call - patient with stomach pain. She go with old and small ambulance from 70s the clinic and with help of man\u2019s neighbor \u2013 put him in car - as quick as she could. She put rest the man after giving him some painkillers. He died in sleep before <i>Doctor Martin</i> come to him.<br /> <br /> After only an hour next call is made to clinic \u2013 <i>Miss Cooper</i>, neighbor of <i>Freddie Butler</i>, said that come to him to eat lunch with old man \u2013 but he died in his sleep. Nurse know well <i>Mister Butler</i> \u2013 she over looked him 4-5 times a week as he was having severe case of Parkinson's. <i>Lian</i> called for the <i>Madeline</i> to help her get next body to funeral home.<br /> <br /> When they were in the car, <i>Reverend</i> <i>Kleckner</i> called to <i>Lian</i>, wanting to know what\u2019s going in his weird deaths in his \u201cflock of sheep\u201d and talking something on cleaning the souls of those that break their rules. He made emphasis to ask if <i>Lian</i> will be on evening mass.<br /> <br /> Rest of work day come rather calmly \u2013 <i>Madeline</i> and <i>Richard</i> had enough work with those bodies as it was. <i>James</i> called only to <i>Lian</i> that his boss, <i>Vladimir</i>, is having some problems \u2013 knowing about his heart condition she come quickly and took baker to the clinic. This time <i>Doctor Martin</i> could help the patient, but <i>Vladimir Vladimirovich </i>need to go for a few days on observation to the Amherst Hospital.<br /> <br /> After work, in evening, <i>Lian</i> and <i>James</i> came to the Church of Good Christians on 18 mass. Five minutes after this hour, temple was locked from the inside and service has started. It was rather typical devotion \u2013 until sermon. Reverend <i>Kleckner</i> said short but flaming speech about people testing God and their faith. That those that left today are pointing ways for Good Christians must be straight, and their actions \u2013 more determined. That in this year, Easter sacrifice must be fuller. He summoned by name <i>Lian</i> and <i>James</i> to stand up. He obligated them to get the offerings at most at Saturday evening mass. For <i>Justin Hale</i>, committed worshiper known from getting all that Good Christians need to \u2013 he said to get one offering for community. Urged all faithful to \u2013 as Knives of Abraham \u2013 were ready to fulfill will of God \u2013 just like Abraham killed his son, Isaac. Just after the mass, Lian explained privately to James what a sacrifice exactly is\u2026<br /> <br /> <b>Note:</b> <i>As you suspect, Good Christians are not so good \u2013 or rather good in our morality sense. Their \u201csacrifice\u201d is human they want to \u201cliberate from hell of life\u201d. More about them is to be <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/799082-cofd-diy-mystery-cults\">found here</a>.</i><br /> At about 19, all characters &quot;heard&quot; the Flemings call of them to the mansion - they all come and in Victorian stylish salon each of them get their own red, palm sized, slightly pulsing crystal from Alchemist, radiating some kind of power - Philosopher\u2019s Stones.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/GtZOtA7.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/GtZOtA7.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <br /> After handing them, Fleming bade characters farewell - and disappeared on their own eye, like he never was!<br /> <b>Note:</b> <i>I probably should made roll characters on Breaking Points for seeing surely supernatural effect. But I reasoned that characters are Sleepwalker now, very slowly starting Awakening, so only magical effect should not come to them. Also, he only disappeared, not changed in to unspeakable beast or something that terrifying.</i><br /> <br /> Characters explored mansion, but found almost nothing than furniture unused for decades - beside great Victorian portrait of some alchemist from at least 150 years old over their heads in salon, the size of one man. Looking <b>exactly</b> like the Fleming that just gone!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/HNOjpCm.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Well, the clothes of modern Fleming were from end of XX century, not half of XIX one. But still, resemblance was uncanny!<br /> <br /> <b>Note:</b> <i>Same as above \u2013 \u201cweird things are going\u201d was not enough, in my mind, to make Integrity Breaking Point roll. Also, some family members have very much the same feature as their ancestors, sometimes\u2026</i><br /> <br /> Deeper search of mansion uncovered four hand written books in their previous host study \u2013 the <i>only</i> left in there - one in classical Latin, from around late Middle Ages, one in old French, from Renaissance, one in old English, from times of Shakespeare and Queen Elizabeth - and one filled with odd symbols or pictographs, difficult to assess from what age. All bound in leather and on very old paper, like personal journals from few centuries back. All have some weird diagrams. Each character took one book \u2013 <i>James</i> took Latin one, <i>Lian</i> French, <i>John</i> English and <i>Madline</i> the odd one.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/bhsz0Rz.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/bhsz0Rz.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <br /> <b>Note:</b><i> Yes, \u201codd symbols and pictograms\u201d are High Speech Runes. In reality, all books are more or less the same book \u2013 called <b>Magnum Opus</b> \u2013 working as Daimonomica for </i>Uncrowned Kings<i> Legacy.</i> <i>The most Rotes encoded are in High Speech book, but also it\u2019s toughest to crack.</i><br /> <br /> <i>Typical page of the book\u2026<br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ei0rDcx.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></i><br /> <br /> Finally, seeing how Fleming looks a like to the pictured alchemist on the portrait, <i>Madeline</i> is dedicated to show the painting to professional art historian. The four of them help them to get it to <i>John\u2019s</i> pickup and <i>Madeline</i> is appointed with him to go next morning to his collage in Amherst. Group has split up and went to home to think about Stones they get for the lives of others. Tomorrow is a day too\u2026<br /> <br /> <b>On Thursday 22<sup>nd</sup> March</b>, things went much calmly, but not without complications. <i>James</i> and <i>Lian</i> had normal day in work. He only called to <i>Lian</i> if she could as <i>Doctor Martin</i> to help him study Latin. Doctor agreed to teach him on working days just after 20, each night.<br /> <br /> <b>Note:</b> <i>Character trying to get Language Merit. </i><br /> <br /> Madeline was preparing to go with <i>John</i> early in the morning, when her brother <i>Richard</i> reminded her that they have two funerals. Lucky or not, before funeral at 12 that was from previous <i>Richard</i>\u2019s client, came older women with little <i>Max</i>. It turned out she is mother of <i>Shannon Evans</i> and come to Wendell to straight things with Hall\u2019s Funeral Home. Grandmother of <i>Max</i> told <i>Madeline</i> that her daughter died in the sleep last night \u2013 probably could not live without husband. As most of family is from Boston, older women asked <i>Madeline</i> to send corpse of <i>Mister Evans </i>to the State\u2019s capitol, on address pointed by her. Sibling agree, talked about logistics details and went to first and only funeral today.<br /> <br /> Being free at 14, even without changing clothes from here formal black suit, <i>Madline</i> and <i>John</i> drove to his collage in Amherst. On campus, they searched for Professor Erika Johnson from History of Art. Even when she is in hurry to leave to home as students canceled classes, she accepts <i>John</i> and <i>Madeline</i>. Interested, she asks how they get the portrait \u2013 when she does not hear the answer, she determined work needed. She does not promise to end everything before the Easter, because employees took leave \u2013 but she will get know to John. Before 16 they ae back in to Wendell.<br /> <br /> At 18, <i>James</i> and <i>Lian</i> again goes on mass, just after dusk \u2013 with tradition of Holy Week there is another mass. This time <i>Reverend Kleckner</i> is much calmer, do not refers in his sermon to latest events in town, highlight only need to follow the ruts of their faith. Lian even waits specially after mass to ask about his milder tone \u2013 Kleckner answers that there is no need to extensively frighten people, because it only cause panic in the flock.<br /> <br /> At night, <i>John </i>for a moment goes to the mansion. Now building seems totally abandoned. He checks for a moment library that is completely empty. Almost, to be precise. On shelves, scattered on whole room, there are three tomes of XX century book about Alchemy as a way to understand one\u2019s mind and psychic development \u2013 Carl\u2019s Gustav Jung <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Psychology_and_Alchemy\" target=\"_blank\">Psychology and Alchemy</a></b>. Just like some have planted\u2026<br /> <br /> In the same time <i>Lian</i> finds in Internet translator of French, just few towns away. <i>Madline</i> searched by occult pages about this weird symbol language \u2013 on of the forums there was mentioning about it as \u201cLanguage of Mediterranean Sea\u201d, from the beginning of Greece and Egypt civilization. And after this discovery, they all went asleep.<br /> <br /> <b>Note:</b> <i>And this is end of Session 1. Madline just get first Clue in greater research on mysterious symbols run on Investigation rules from <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> rulebook. More idea on Mystery of High Speech can be <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/810506-mystery-high-speech-and-it-s-origins\">read in this topic</a>.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-08-2016, 05:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-08T11:33:47-08:00","id":826096,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Philosopher\u2019s Stone \u2013 Session 2</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Wednesday 23<sup>rd</sup> March</b> started normally for residents of Wendell \u2013 but ended with dark truths.<br /> <i>John Beckett</i> has been suddenly called to his collage in Amherst on business matter \u2013 so he was not available for this and next day.<br /> <br /> <b>Note:</b> <i>John\u2019s</i> <i>player could not join us on game session.</i> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Because of ill health of <i>Vladimir Vladimirovich</i>, <i>James Rodney</i> looked for the help to run bakery for the couple of days. And indeed, later in afternoon come to him <i>Jacob Safar</i>, young, twenty something half Arabic boy that moved with his mother to the town just after New Year. <i>James</i> shown him for the rest of the work day most important secrets of job. <i>Madeleine Hall </i>and<i> Lian Mavis</i> spent the rest of the day over dead and living persons, respectively.<br /> <br /> After Wednesday mass in Church of Good Christians, \u201cgifted\u201d by Fleming went to study their Philosopher\u2019s Stones, in their own homes. <i>Madeleine</i><b>,</b> after few uses and experiments on her Stone \u2013 like watching it color and slight pulsating light. Then she tried to listening to it \u2013 hearing faintly sounds of heart beating inside she would be a bit scared \u2013 unless she was so calm and rational girl she is. She even humming to Stone! Finally just decided to close her hand and very hard to think about her dream - eternal life! The thunder of white light and massive headache a tearing her consciousness made her fall on the floor. She awoken with the return waves of migraine, but she felt so\u2026 alive.<br /> <br /> <b>Note: </b><i>I made Philosopher\u2019s Stone to work mechanically as constant spell on the character that can mimic Practice up to 6 dots in Arcanum ( yes, slight Imperial Mysteries can be achieved with it ) or up to 5-6 dots in Merits. Players wrote those effects as special free given Merit. Madeleine choose \u201cImmortality\u201d, so she got effect replicating Life 5 Regeneration and general \u201clongevity\u201d from her Stone.</i><br /> <br /> In the same time, <i>James</i> also experiments with Stone. He almost on first try activated it and gets his own lifelong dream \u2013 he finally get to know knowledge of languages he always wanted! He understood it when he just could read all the Fleming\u2019s Latin book.<br /> <br /> <b>Note: </b><i>James get 5 dot Language Merit, meaning he can choose up to 5 Languages he now knows, beside English. To not let player to feel a bit cheated in choosing static power in game, I said he can change this list of those 5 languages once per day for the Willpower <u>Dot</u>. (As game Trait) Character can buy back later on those Dots by cost of 1 Experience each. </i><br /> <br /> <i>Lian </i>still do not think about her dreams or Stone. She tries to arrange translation of book from old French via Internet, but the costs for those would be in thousands of dollars. <i>Madeleine</i> and <i>James</i> spent rest of the night on studying the weird language of book and reading the content of Alchemists book, respectively.<br /> <br /> <i>Madeleine</i> dig for few hours on the Internet for the writing in \u201cher\u201d book, this time using a bit uncovered occult meaning behind those marks and connecting them to historical secret languages. She finds that some marks looks like those found in Enochian \u2013 mysterious lounge of angels that has been uncovered to the John Dee and Edward Kelley, two famous English occultists from XVI century. From their records, Enochian was language in that God created world, and before banishing Adam \u2013 he contacted angels and his Creator in it.<br /> <br /> <b>Note: </b><i>Madeleine uncovered second Clue in her research on the \u201cweird language\u201d. As she was using second time her Occult Skill to Uncover Clue, she was having cumulative -1 penalty. She used the only Element from first Clue (about \u201cLanguage of Mediterranean Sea\u201d) and used it to cancel penalty. The \u201cEnochian Language\u201d Clue has 1 new Element in it \u2013 Madeleine will probably use it for the new Uncovering Clue, next time she will research subject. If she will use third time Occult Skill to Uncover the Clue, she will roll with -2 penalty.</i><br /> <br /> <i>James</i>, on the other hand, is reading the Latin version of book to the pillow. He uncovers its titled <b>Opus Magnum</b> and about Alchemy. As he is totally layman in matters of myths and mysteries, he cannot grasp the meaning of the text. Closest to him are diagrams in it, looking like some chemical formulas, only without larger sense to him. The books first part is about something called <b>Nigredo</b>. <i>James</i> tries to find something online on this term. He founds some Satanists page about sacrificing children to the dark forces in Nigredo. Spooked, he has a bit problem to lay in to rest at night...<br /> <br /> <b>Note:</b><i> James do not have any dot of Occult. Seeing as how small dice pool he will have, players choose to make Dramatic Failure from I</i> <i>Intelligence+Occult roll on Internet research \u2013 and that\u2019s why Satanists link. I gave character Spooked (Alchemy) Condition and player took a Beat from worsening his Failure. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></i><br /> <br /> <b>On Thursday 24<sup>th</sup> March</b> <i>Madeleine</i> and <i>James</i> works from the dawn.<i> James</i> shows the ropes for the young <i>Jacob</i>. <i>Madeleine</i> lays next \u201cclients\u201d from last days with her brother. <i>Lian</i> in her free time in job\u2026 talks with Mister Butler in the broom cupboard of clinic, hearing his heart bit in Stone. He\u2019s also calling, vaguely to her. But she cannot crack what he is says\u2026<br /> <br /> After the mass, all three meet at <i>James</i> house to made meeting over the identity of their mysterious patron and what is content of books he left them. <i>James</i> translates for them Fleming\u2019s books \u2013 two that he can, at least. This weird language of Madeline\u2019s book is reasoning with few words in his own head, but he cannot understand it, how much he tries. Both codex he <i>can</i> translate are transcriptions of roughly the same work from two different eras and languages \u2013 classical, Medieval Latin and old, Renaissance French. Books title is the one and same \u2013 <b>\u201eOpus Magnum\u201d</b> \u2013 <i>Great Work</i>.<br /> <br /> He read it to both girls. Text starts with very odd poem:<br /> <br /> \u201cIn the name of the rose, in the name of the cross: The covenant is mysterious.<br /> Torn darkness is in dark vaults.<br /> Red seals the mouth.<br /> In the intoxication of my sensations, I hear enchanted whispers.<br /> The clocks stand still.<br /> Gray things are reflected and flicker on the wall.<br /> The chime sounds gloomily.<br /> <br /> In the sea of desire, in the knowledge of the believers: torment is frightened.<br /> Pitiful anxieties in pale faces; they are ready for the ritual.<br /> <br /> Great work finds me.<br /> I am pure like white blood.<br /> Great work binds me.<br /> Take me into your circle.<br /> <br /> The eternal rights are changing.<br /> I will leave life silently.<br /> I will bring the end through truly tested faith.<br /> <br /> The chest is cut through.<br /> The innocent will be sacrificed.<br /> Therefore it is necessary to clean my blood.<br /> I am greatly dead.\u201d<br /> <br /> Reading this aloud, <i>James</i> even want to toss books and shut it up for good. Both girls are calming him down a bit.<br /> <br /> <b>Note:</b> <i>James resolved his Spooked Condition, getting Beat for ending Condition. And yes, poem is lyrics of E Nomine song Opus Magnum \u2013 I advise to listen it for inspiration. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GbrQfJ1VIps\" target=\"_blank\"> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GbrQfJ1VIps\" data-code=\"GbrQfJ1VIps\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/GbrQfJ1VIps/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></a><br /> <br /> <i>Madeline</i> is almost sure that Nick Fleming is not he other than <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nicolas_Flamel\" target=\"_blank\">Nicholas Flamel</a> himself, great Alchemist of Paris!<br /> <br /> All three read more about <b>Nigredo</b> phase online. The information are very interesting:<br /> <br /> <i>\u201eProcess of transmutation for metals in Opus Magnum starts from darkening phase called Nigredo. Then mix everything with everything, in a sealed alchemical retort, destroying and killing essence of now substance, when finally ending, she could in longer run of changes could transform its nature in to perfect\u2026\u201d</i><br /> <br /> <b>Note:</b> <i>It was typical Intelligence+Occult roll, with slight bonus for having Internet.</i><br /> <br /> <i>Madeline </i>even found information that Nostradamus connected Nigredo with passion of Christ on Good Friday - which is tomorrow! They talked more about it all and Already they have to split \u2013 when<br /> to <i>Madeline</i> got text from <i>John</i>\u2026<br /> <br /> <b><i>Note: </i></b><i>And it\u2019s end of Session 2 with small cliff hanger. Now, you can help me all a bit\u2026 </i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Plot Problem</b></span><br /> As you can see, I have a bit problem to explore Action element in game. We are two sessions in the play and the most Action inducing scene was when Nurse tried to get quickly to patient that called 911. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I was thinking about using <i>Justin Hale</i> as menacing rivalry that wants to push characters \u2013 but I do not see this before Saturday evening. Or at least when <i>Lian</i> and <i>James</i> decides to get \u201csacrifice\u201d. <b>Maybe you have some suggestions as to how rise the adrenaline of players in a setting like this? I also thought that with longer play as mortals, maybe adding some Horror to the story would be nice idea. If you think about good one, let me know. </b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-08-2016, 02:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-08T13:18:42-08:00","id":826202,"title":"","content":"Knowingly or not, your characters did just murder several people for their own gain. Have the ghosts of their victims linger with each character, or their Philosopher's Stone, serving as the ghosts anchor. Activities at the church, I'm referring to the blood sacrifices, would have attracted all sorts of unpleasant spirits, spirits that now may be attracted to your characters or their stones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-16T05:25:49-07:00","id":866349,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m coming back with sum ups of game sessions from last two months \u2013 look for more of my posts in next weeks. Waiting for comments and advises from you.<br /> <br /> <b>Note:</b><i> In this game session I used three brand new ghosts I made based on Philosophers Stone\u2019s victims, listening to </i><b><i>2ptTakrill</i></b><i> advice. Full stats will be shared when players will end plotline. But you were warned \u2013 this game is now officially a ghost(s) story. </i><i><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Nigredo, part 1 \u2013 Session 3</b></span><br /> <i>\u201eProcess of transmutation for metals in Opus Magnum starts from darkening phase called Nigredo. Then mix everything with everything, in a sealed alchemical retort, destroying and killing essence of now substance, when finally ending, she could in longer run of changes could transform its nature in to perfect\u2026\u201d</i><br /> <br /> <b>It\u2019s morning of Friady 25th March 2016 in Wendell, Massachusetts.</b> Only few hours ago, in Thursday evening, lives of \u201egifted\u201d by alchemists Nick Fleming were overturned. After suddenly interrupted deliberation at <b>James Rodney</b>, when he needed to quickly leave his house, <b>Madline</b> and <b>Lian</b> wetn to local dinner <i>\u201eValerie\u2019s\u201d</i> - run by stout <b>Valerie Tucker</b>. They looked on to next courtship of <b>Robert Bustos</b> \u2013 veteran from Vietnam, more or less in age of Valerie, that eats almost only in this local. He lost left arm on war, decade ago. He stills try to rouse Miss Tucker.<br /> <br /> When girls eat their dinner and excellent apple pies, there started weird things. First <b>Madleine\u2019s </b>fork fell on his own under table. After, when they split up because <b>Madliene</b> had round around Cemetary this night, poor <b>Lian</b> would swore that in her pastry human fingernail! Valerie very much took over the problems with her cooking. And much more when over there was nothing wrong in it as fingernail were not in dish.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Note: </b>I used here </i>Telekinesis <i>Numina of ghost connected to <b>Madleine</b> and </i>Image<i> Manifestation of one anchoring to <b>Lian</b>\u2019s.</i><br /> <br /> Later, when <b>Madline</b> lonely \u201epatrolling\u201d Cemetery \u2013 according to centuries old tradition of Hall family \u2013 she meets clearly weeping women standing near tomb stone of with written name \u201cJack Evans\u201d. She instantly recognize Miss Evans on that she knew is dead!<br /> <br /> <i><b>Note:</b> First Integrity Breaking Point in chronicle! Player rolls Resolve+Composure -1 for witnessing non-violent supernatural, but get\u2019s +1 for high Integrity ( value 7 in this case ). <b>Madline</b> pass it, so she only got </i>Spooked<i> Condition.</i><br /> <br /> When <b>Madline </b>enter in discussion with her, she wants to prove her that she is dead \u2013 girl lead her to funeral home, but Miss Evans cannot bypass buildings threshold, standing motionless before doors. High school girl enters inside to get documents. When she returns, resentful ghost of Miss Evans tries to attack on <b>Madline</b> for nothing \u2013 but she turns papers from her hands.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Note: </b>Miss Evans ghosts do not \u201eknow\u201d she is dead \u2013 and when confronted with the fact, ghost lose her Integrity ( from 7 to 6 ). Furious and confused, she lashes on <b>Madline</b> with </i>Telekinesis<i> Numina.</i><br /> <br /> In the meantime, <b>Lian Mavis</b> is very naughty lady. She takes her old, work ambulance ( like from <i>Ghostsbusters</i> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) and goes to Lubrock \u2013 even smaller town, about 15 minutes in dens New England of Wendell. There she goes on border of settlement with forest and hides car near local rock bar. Lurking in the bushes, <b>Lian</b> waits for her prey to come out of premise. Indeed, few minutes later comes out very drunk black hair twenty something girl, that however, very stubbornly wants to return to home on foot. <b>Lian</b> just wants to grab her, but see in bar window some man watch over girl. When drunk passes her, nurse surprise her with chloroform and drag to ambulance, where she straps her to stretcher. However, men runs from bar and yell \u201eAlice, Alice\u201d. <b>Lian</b> knows she can have problems. Men clearly hear something and he went in to direction of bushes with nurse \u2013 but he changed his mind, barely three metres from her! <b>Lian</b> drive to Wendell with this year offering.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Note:</b> When <b>Lian</b> was seen by the men, player roll Composure + Stealth vs Wits + Composure of men. She passed the test, but barely, so why men almost get her. Just when leaving Lubrock I asked player to roll Integrity Breaking Point \u2013 she kidnapped girl, even if it is all to destroy the Good Christians cult in the end. She rolled her Resolve + Composure + 1 ( for Integrity 7 ) + 1 ( for good intentions, I treated it as working under Virtue ) \u2013 3 ( for kidnapping itself, I treated it as torture ). This player did not pass and character get </i>Guilty <i>Condition. <b>Lian</b> is eaten alive by her remorse, that is fighting under her consciousness.</i><br /> <br /> It\u2019s 1 a.m. in Friday 25th March 2016 year. <b>Lian</b> comes to Wendell. <b>Madline</b>, on her route in Cemetery, sees ambulance entering town In the middle of the night. Interested, she shadow nurse to church of Good Christians where with mayor <b>Walter Boddie </b>they hide young girl from Lubrock, <b>Alice</b>. They go down to secret crypt under alter where is marble catafalque like from medieval torture chamber with shackles and mask that muffle screams. Both straps unconsciousnes girl.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Walter Boddie - Wendell's mayor</b></i><br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/m3RDgOy.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> At the same time, <b>John</b> hides across behind next bushes, interested in commotion under church. <b>Madline</b> and <b>John </b>watch in two cult members in their wicked actions. <b>John</b> makes pictures from hideout of whole events. Finally, <b>Madline</b> is confronting mayor and <b>Lian \u2013</b> high school girl is threatening couple, but quickly they bounce it that Wendell is in control of Good Christians. Abashed, <b>Madline</b> leave and returns to her house. When they end, mayor and nurse split their ways in the middle of night. However, <b>John</b> has pictures of them!<br /> <br /> <i><b>Note:</b> John get three </i>Leverage<i> Conditions from his taking photos \u2013 on <b>Mayor Boddie</b>, on <b>Lian</b> and on <b>Madline</b> for partaking in possible kidnaping. <b>Madeline</b> tried to intimidate two other with Presence+Intimidation roll, but <b>Mayor</b> and <b>Lian </b>defeated her in contested rolls as they use teamwork rules to win on Resolve + Composure roll and marking Wendell as their territory. After whole action <b>Lian</b> makes Integrity Breaking Point roll for condemning Alice to at least imprisonment, with the similar modifiers as last time, only marking -2 instead -3 for the torture variant. She get\u2019s success and is free of next Condition.</i><br /> <br /> About 2 A.M. <b>Madline </b>looks for informations on Net about binding the ghosts with own will alone by occultists because she is fascinated with them from the meeting one this night. After the hour of maybe fruitful research about something that those circles call Ban and Banes on forums and books of \u201cephemeral beings\u201d , she comes on to weird page that shows frightening video that say that \u201cher souls is their now\u201d. Something changed in <b>Madline </b>\u2013 from now on she would see ghosts <i>everywhere</i> \u2013 even when they would not be there. Rest of the night she does not sleep, trying to solve mystery of commanding the undead, but she does not find something new. <b>John </b>also don\u2019t sleep, because he has returning nightmares about girl taken by the demons\u2026<br /> <br /> <i><b>Note:</b><b> Madline </b>started to dig into lore about ghosts because of her </i>Spooked<i> Condition. Roll was made based on Research rules for Ephemeral Beings ( page 149 in <b>Chronicles of Darkness </b>rulebook ). Character get 1 success of 5 needed for the ghost of Ms. Evans ( Rank 2 ghost ) she would normally need \u2013 so she got vague idea that there are things like Bans and Banes. Getting normal Failure on the Extended Action roll, player decided that want to change it to the Dramatic Failure. We agreed on</i> Madness ( Ghosts )<i> Persistant Condtion that sounds cool for future Moros character. For the going with research character resolve </i>Spooked<i> Condition getting Beat, but do not get back Willpower point for the resting. <b>John </b>also did not get one after getting Beat from </i>Nightmares<i> Condition. <b>Lian</b>, instead, get Willpower point back as resting for the night.</i><br /> <br /> About 6 in the morning, at <b>Lian</b>\u2019s house, there appears half-awoken <b>Madline</b>. She says to host that she will spill everything out and show real actions of Good Christians. In reality girl wants to provoke Lian to get there as next sacrifice. A bit panicked, nurse calls to <b>Reverand</b> <b>Kleckner</b> to \u201csolve matter\u201d. He sends <b>Justin Hale</b>, known as loyal Knife of Abraham, even when he has reputation on congregation of being a bit unstable. <b>John</b> was heading to <b>Madline</b>, reading text she sends him with questions about ghosts in night - and the he see black SUV that <b>Hale</b> is going to <b>Lian</b> house and start to shadow him.<br /> <br /> <i>Justin Hale and his dangerous look...</i><br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/SZ3c2Zq.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Situation quickly becomes tense. What\u2019s strange, <b>Madline</b> only stands and torment <b>Lian</b> possibilities of raveling her\u2019s and mayor\u2019s secret. <b>Justin</b> enters the home in his half military clothes and Desert Eagle in hand by the unlocked front doors. When he goes upstairs, <b>John</b> sneaks in safe distance to him. On the upper floor goes on cold fight between ladies. <b>Hale</b> quickly ends it, when he target in <b>Madline</b> with gun, demanding that she went to his car. High school girl resist a moment, but agrees quickly and going before him with <b>Lian</b>, they go down stairs. Listening them, <b>John</b> is preparing to surprise <b>Hale</b>\u2019a. Seeing <b>John</b> in front her, <b>Madline</b> shackles on stairs and tries to pretend legs contusion so Good Christian need to care of her and divert their attention. However <b>Lian</b>\u2019s nurse experience quickly points that school girl is trying to fool them.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Note: Madline</b> try to mark contusion with Manipulation+Athletics and <b>Lian</b> just see past to it with Wits+Medicine, wining contested roll by 4 successes. I reminded the players that ending fight in non-violent way from they side can grant them Willpower point.</i><br /> <br /> They still go downstairs , and <b>John</b> use momentary chaos to attack <b>Justin</b>. Lecturer shoots <b>Hale</b> with his Glock 17, sadly missing. <b>Lian</b> takes out her knife, hidden under pants buckle, threatening <b>Madline</b>. <b>Justin</b> answers shooting with his Desert Eagle \u2013 experience, coordination and the force of weapon itself make that on <b>John</b> blooms bloody stain, and he almost lose conciseness. Big wound on chest is bleeding, and he is more and more closer to death. When <b>John </b>finally collapse, <b>Hale</b> wants so ladies took him to car<b>. </b>It\u2019s spark a short quarrel who of them should take care about wounds and how they sit in car. In the end, it\u2019s <b>Madline </b>that deals with bleeding on back seat, when <b>Lian</b> aims in both of them and <b>Justin</b> is driving them to church, only few minutes after dawn.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Note: </b>I was using <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/hurt-locker-equipment-appendix/\" target=\"_blank\">beta rules from <b>Hurt Locker</b></a>. Glock\u2019s and Desert Eagle starts are from the file. <b>Justin </b>got Defense equal to Glock\u2019s Size + 1 as characters shoot in Close Range. John got 5 Lethal damage from Justin shot, that is way higher than his Stamina 2 \u2013 so he ended with </i>Bleeding<i> Tilt and get 1 Bashing Damage per turn. Quickly you can see he passed out in 2 turns \u2013 i.e. 6 seconds. First Aid roll ( see Medical Care in <b>Chronicles of Darkness Rulebook</b>, page 96 ) have stopped </i>Bleeding<i> and more damage to come on him. <b>John</b> get Beat from the \u201clast three health box marked\u201d and second for resolving </i>Bleeding <i>Tilt.</i><br /> <br /> Group, under watchful eye of <b>Justin</b>, comes to temple of Good Christians, typically made in American style - wooden structure painted on white. Morning mass have only started. A dozen of believers head now for communion, when doors of church are open dynamical by <b>Lian</b>. <b>Justin</b> caring <b>John</b> on his hands goes through main nave, straight to alter by which stands <b>Reverand</b><b> Kleckner. </b>Right after him goes <b>Lian</b> that leads <b>Madline</b>, pointing knife in her back. However, school girl do not care, as she sees \u201cghosts\u201d with what she talks, even no one other sees the in church. Finally unconscious<b> John</b> and <b>Madline</b> end in crypt under alter, shackled to walls with heavy chains like medieval prisoners. In center of chamber the see twenty-something from Lubrock that do not have any more strength to scream and move on catafalque, with iron mask that blocks her voice. Below with them stays <b>Lian</b> that will take care of wounds of tomorrow sacrifices. When they are left alone, <b>Lian </b>confess <b>Madline </b>that she stayed here, as she wants also to destroy Good Christians cult and free all sacrifices before ceremony. Then <b>Madline</b> said she only threatened with leak as she wanted that nurse would abduct her, so she could kill <b>Kleckner</b> in tomorrow ceremony. Reaching an agreement, ladies are taking care on the <b>John</b>\u2019s wounds till he get back awareness. Whole trio locked in crypt under church made a plan what need to be done, in front of innocent girl from Lubrock.<br /> <br /> <b>It\u2019s morning of Friady 25th March 2016</b><b> year</b><b>.</b> Town of Wendell in state of Massachusetts seems calm and peaceful, thoughtfully before coming Easter. But only it\u2019s citizens may watch tragedy that in their eyes will be road to Salvation...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-16-2016, 09:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T05:11:09-07:00","id":866761,"title":"","content":"Re: omitting Breaking points:<br /> <br /> You should've let them roll anyway, no Integrity loss, just getting Spooked on failed roll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T05:25:23-07:00","id":866765,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tambov</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/825300-cod-mage-magnum-opus-actual-play?p=866761#post866761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Re: omitting Breaking points:<br /> <br /> You should've let them roll anyway, no Integrity loss, just getting Spooked on failed roll.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are not all Breaking Points rolls always risking Integrity? No risk, no fun?<br /> <br /> I could just ask for Willpower (dots) roll and give Condition on failure, without treating it as Breaking Point - remember, each Breaking Point <b>roll</b> is extra Beat for character, independently on result.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-04T12:35:02-07:00","id":907231,"title":"","content":"Next part of our supernatural drama. In topic we are about 4 session late, but I started to make characters Awaken in proper timeline. Will be making recap here for whole <i>'Nigredo'</i> story and then paste new content in <b>Mage</b> forum, as it will be proper <b>Awakening </b>chronicle then. Will post here link at the end to it. Still, all comments are more than welcome for &quot;Mortal&quot; part of the game. And now...<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Nigredo, part 2 \u2013 Session 4</span></b><br /> <i>\u201eProcess of transmutation for metals in Opus Magnum starts from darkening phase called Nigredo. Then mix everything with everything, in a sealed alchemical retort, destroying and killing essence of now substance, when finally ending, she could in longer run of changes could transform its nature in to perfect\u2026\u201d</i><br /> <br /> <b>It\u2019s 10 a.m. in Good Friday of 25<sup>th</sup> March 2016 </b>and cult of Good Christians from Wendell, Massachusetts hunts now on running people that escape from their slavery and throw them a challenge. Barely three hours earlier <b>John Beckett</b>, <b>Lian Mavis</b> i <b>Madline Hall</b> are locked in neo-gothic crypt under church in town with half awake girl from Lubrock try to come up with plan of escape and defeating of cultists. Strong guilt, enhanced by sighting with iron gag <b>Alice</b>, makes that <b>Lian</b> is opening and ask for forgiveness for her actions.<br /> <br /> <b><i>Note:</i></b><i> Lian had </i>Guilty <i>Condition from previous game session after kidnaping of <b>Alice</b> NPC. Short talk and try to play on emotion before players group was a way to resolve it - and get a Beat. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></i><br /> <br /> When they setup bold move to kill priest at sacrifice ceremony tomorrow night, crypts enter opens under alter. Downstairs, sauntered moves slightly round, grayish, middle aged <b>pastor Kleckner</b>. He says something about great mission, goal and dedication. He ask the if they are ready for final sacrifice. When <b>John</b> answers him with salty comments, something disturbing is happening with pastor \u2013 behind him, when he presents the vision of the salvation of their souls \u2013 starts to show greenish glow, at start barely seen, then more and more profound. In the end <b>Lian</b>, even when not saying anything \u2013 see some angelic being after priest. Being quickly feads away, but nurse is moves. <b>Kleckner</b> say she should come with him \u2013 and even when Lian tries discrytly leave crypt\u2019s door ajar \u2013 she can\u2019t. She goes out with pastor outside of church.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Note:</b> \u201cAngel\u201d is Shadow Spirit connected to Good Christians practice of sacrifice. I will now do not dwell into details, but this could be his Image Manifestation. Or that PCs are slowly starting to Awake and see pass the Lie. Either way players were more interested from that moment. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <b>Lian </b>tried to leave unlocked crypt entrance with Dexterity + Stealth, but get Failure, and the tomb was totally shut.</i><br /> <br /> In other part of town, precisely at 3 a.m., twenty-something grocery store cashier on punk look was sleeping. <b>Lorraine</b> in her dream see angel, with sword in one hand and torch in other. He stood in radiance of green light, and world was burning around him\u2026<br /> <br /> At 7 a.m. alarm clock is waking girl to stand up. At 8 a.m. she was supposed to get to only store in town \u2013 and yet she had to get weed to one of her clients on other end of settlement. Walking by the center of town she passes\u2026 Yes, green angel, like from her dream. As image in stained glass At church of Good Christians. Curious she enters empty temple.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, <b>Lian</b> is preparing herself to confrontation with pastor on next day. Using stores of closed on Great Friday local clinic, she wants to create poison. Unfortunate, she overestimated her skills, so minor accident on mixing chemicals ends with inhalation of fumes that clear her memory of few last hours.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Note: Lian </b>player was rolling </i>Building Equipment <i>( see page 100 on <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> <b>Rulebook</b> ). She roll on Science + Intelligence, with -4 penalty as she wanted a very powerful toxin that would put <b>pastor Klackner</b> in mere seconds ( turns time ). Unfortunately, roll was unsuccessful, so player wanted to change it into Dramatic Failure. She get </i>Amnesia<i> Condition from me. We stated she loose memory of only last 12 hours.</i><br /> <br /> In church, <b>Lorraine</b> quickly looks around and hears muffed sounds under the alter. She searched nearby of it and founds secret switch in step close to it. Hearing working mechanics and seeing how slab is uncovering, she comes downstairs in to neo-gothic crypt lit by two oil lamps on opposing walls.<br /> <br /> Inside she finds catafalque on what lay young brunette chained and with iron gag on face. Around her, to one wall, chained are <b>John</b> and <b>Madline</b>. Young punk want to help them, but quickly she is startled because of closing foot steps in their way. <b>Lorraine</b> fast hides behind slab.<br /> <br /> It turns out that to crypt comes <b>Lian</b> that remembers there should be ceremony at 9 a.m. Hearing sounds coming from under alter, she wanted to check what is going on. Inside she is confronted with others gifted by Fleming and events of last night. Discussion takes a while and nurse realizes holes in here memory \u2013 and that she kidnapped girl from Lubrok. But conversation is ended with sounds of military boots in on church floor, echoing a bit in building, closing on to them.<br /> <br /> To crypt comes <b>Justin Hall</b>, known as loyal, but also slightly hasty member of Good Christians cult. Almost forty year old black hair bearded man with athletic body shape under heavy jeans jacket and khaki pants. Flexing his muscles threateningly, even he does not tower over his prisoners. When <b>John</b> starts again mouth off, <b>Justin</b> does not indulges him and hits anthropologist head, from what researcher instantly lose conciseness. Then kidnapped start to make fuss, so military quickly make her lose conciseness. Cultist obviously wants to know more about characters, so he ask others. He argues about it with <b>Lian</b>, moving around crypt. <b>Lorraine</b> still try to miss his eyesight sliding between walls of catafalque, even when is good half hour of this charade. In the end <b>Justin</b> exits, leaving \u2018sacrifices\u2019 under care of <b>Lian</b>. When only sounds silent on the stairs of temple, nurse and punk release prisoners from chains. Four of them sneaks out from church and goes in to nearby forest. By the way the left unconscious <b>Alice</b> from Lubrok in ditch. <b>Lian</b> stays in church, posing as beaten up and defeated.<br /> <br /> <b>It\u2019s 10 a.m. in Good Friday of 25<sup>th</sup> March 2016 </b>and cult of Good Christians from Wendell, Massachusetts hunts now on running people that escape from their slavery and throw them a challenge. They do not know that <b>Lian Mavis</b> \u2013 supposedly faithful local nurse \u2013 works with other \u2018gifted\u2019 to overthrow. How really will be sacrifice in this alchemical reaction?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-04-2016, 03:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}